title Cassette (deck, 640x480 at 11.3 px/mm): settings, rows of the toolkit ROW (79 px), the top and scrolled; a drag from a label scrolls
sizes 640x480
ppmm 1130
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
key s
wait 400
shot deck-settings
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
scrollmark
dragon "Codec" -0.2
expect scrolled
drag 0.5 0.8 0.5 0.15
drag 0.5 0.8 0.5 0.15
drag 0.5 0.8 0.5 0.15
wait 500
shot deck-settings-scrolled
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
